  m_Name: Acoustician Vesper
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Acoustician Vesper
  offerText: The industrial city noise is slowly destroying your eardrums. Pay my
    fee, and I will install heavy lead-lined acoustic panels. It takes up wall space,
    but your physical health will improve drastically.
  acceptResultText: The heavy panels completely mute the outside world. It is great
    for your ears, but the absolute, dead, suffocating silence quickly drives you
    insane with loneliness and paranoia.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the ugly panels. The loud city sirens keep you awake
    and give you a headache, but at least you don't feel buried alive.
